{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"中大珊瑚學院基地開幕\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/2026-10-24-12-41-42bl30bym0.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】中大珊瑚學院基地開幕。</p><p>漁農自然護理署副署長黎存志出席開幕典禮。基地在政府環境及自然保育基金等各方支持下成立，是全港首個專門從事珊瑚有性繁殖室內培育設施，現時正培育逾4500株幼年珊瑚。學院期望隨基地落成，可改善珊瑚幼體的繁殖環境。</p><p>珊瑚學院於2018年成立，致力推廣珊瑚及海洋保育。</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T05:22:40.745331+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":150,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T04:37:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T10:58:09.470459+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T05:18:14.331689+00:00","content_hash":"b42717b4db19c3f9ec5edf9b5c4681cc2dc8dd300b42f27fcddbda0bdb406a6e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-24T05:22:40.745331+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}